Hey, that's really not bad!

Here's some details for people for using this:

Install https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=kl.ime.oh

Instal https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=klye.plugin.lj
as gleki said.

Do the usual keyboard setup dance.

Slide off the space bar, find "languages" in the upper left, go into
"abc" (by which he apparently means "latin alphabet languages"),
find Lojban.

After that, a slide from space to the right will switch languages.

I also reccomend sliding from the gear icon to "auto" and adding
auto space.

